{
  "id": "1090",
  "title": "There is Something in My Eye",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-09-30",
  "synopsis": "There is something (lovely) in Little He’s eye.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1090/c7009574c8989578147e816773944525211fb1ff.mp3?1596878533",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我的眼睛里有东西\n\n小何：亲爱的，你帮我看看我的眼睛里是不是有什么东西？\n丽丽：好的，我看看。什么都没有啊！\n小何：怎么可能？我的眼睛里有你啊，我的眼里都是你。",
    "traditional": "我的眼睛裡有東西\n\n小何：親愛的，你幫我看看我的眼睛裡是不是有什麼東西？\n麗麗：好的，我看看。什麼都沒有啊！\n小何：怎麼可能？我的眼睛裡有你啊，我的眼裡都是你。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "There is Something in My Eye"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小何：亲爱的，你帮我看看我的眼睛里是不是有什么东西？",
      "traditional": "小何：親愛的，你幫我看看我的眼睛裡是不是有什麼東西？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé qīn ài de nǐ bāng wǒ kàn kan wǒ de yǎn jing lǐ shì bú shì yǒu shén me dōng xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Darling, can you help me take a look at my eye to see if there is something there?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：好的，我看看。什么都没有啊！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：好的，我看看。什麼都沒有啊！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hǎo de wǒ kàn kan shén me dōu méi yǒu a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: OK, I will take a look. Nothing is there!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小何：怎么可能？",
      "traditional": "小何：怎麼可能？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé zěn me kě néng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我的眼睛里有你啊，我的眼里都是你。",
      "traditional": "我的眼睛裡有你啊，我的眼裡都是你。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ de yǎn jing lǐ yǒu nǐ a wǒ de yǎn lǐ dōu shì nǐ",
      "english": "Little He: How is that possible?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You are in my eyes. All I see is you."
    }
  ],
